Layered\ architecture\ considering\ only\ dependencies\ in\ layers,\ consisting\ of\nlayer\ 'Controller'\ ('com.mycompany.hotelmanagersystem.*.controller..')\nlayer\ 'Filter'\ ('com.mycompany.hotelmanagersystem.*.filter..')\nlayer\ 'Service'\ ('com.mycompany.hotelmanagersystem.*.service..')\nlayer\ 'Dao'\ ('com.mycompany.hotelmanagersystem.*.dao..')\nwhere\ layer\ 'Controller'\ may\ not\ be\ accessed\ by\ any\ layer\nwhere\ layer\ 'Filter'\ may\ not\ be\ accessed\ by\ any\ layer\nwhere\ layer\ 'Service'\ may\ only\ be\ accessed\ by\ layers\ ['Controller',\ 'Filter']\nwhere\ layer\ 'Dao'\ may\ only\ be\ accessed\ by\ layers\ ['Service'],\ because\ Controller\ chi\ goi\ Service,\ Service\ chi\ goi\ Dao\ (QT\ 3.1-3.3)=2dacf890-b654-4a73-a9e9-a9c2ada6493e
classes\ that\ are\ annotated\ with\ @WebServlet\ should\ reside\ in\ a\ package\ 'com.mycompany.hotelmanagersystem.*.controller..',\ because\ Moi\ @WebServlet\ phai\ nam\ trong\ goi\ controller\ (QT\ 3.1)=6e63c507-5a48-43bd-8d28-15038c4f8413
no\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ any\ package\ ['com.mycompany.hotelmanagersystem.*.controller..',\ 'com.mycompany.hotelmanagersystem.*.service..',\ 'com.mycompany.hotelmanagersystem.*.filter..']\ should\ depend\ on\ classes\ that\ have\ simple\ name\ 'DBContext',\ because\ Chi\ Dao\ duoc\ mo\ ket\ noi\ CSDL\ (QT\ 3.1)=934a6aa3-6e47-420b-bd10-83bc147c0a81
no\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ any\ package\ ['com.mycompany.hotelmanagersystem.*.controller..',\ 'com.mycompany.hotelmanagersystem.*.service..']\ should\ depend\ on\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ a\ package\ 'java.sql..',\ because\ JDBC\ chi\ duoc\ nam\ o\ tang\ Dao;\ Service\ dung\ java.time\ thay\ cho\ java.sql.Date\ (QT\ 3.1,\ 3.2)=d72d32fe-bf64-42fd-b26a-19a3d44c6fa5
no\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ any\ package\ ['com.mycompany.hotelmanagersystem.*.dto..',\ 'com.mycompany.hotelmanagersystem.*.model..']\ should\ depend\ on\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ any\ package\ ['com.mycompany.hotelmanagersystem.*.controller..',\ 'com.mycompany.hotelmanagersystem.*.service..',\ 'com.mycompany.hotelmanagersystem.*.dao..'],\ because\ DTO/Model\ khong\ chua\ logic\ truy\ cap\ du\ lieu\ hay\ nghiep\ vu\ (QT\ 3.4)=86764bf6-d813-4cf4-bac7-920f968d306b
no\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ any\ package\ ['com.mycompany.hotelmanagersystem.*.service..',\ 'com.mycompany.hotelmanagersystem.*.dao..',\ 'com.mycompany.hotelmanagersystem.*.dto..',\ 'com.mycompany.hotelmanagersystem.*.model..']\ should\ depend\ on\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ any\ package\ ['javax.servlet..',\ 'jakarta.servlet..'],\ because\ Chi\ Controller/Filter\ duoc\ biet\ HttpServletRequest/Session\ (QT\ 3.2,\ 3.3,\ 3.4)=b17dcf21-c025-4ee2-9ed1-11d8832374c8
